post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
SporeModder FX keeps its settings, mod bundles and default Projects folder in
$XDG_DATA_HOME/sporemodder-fx (~/.local/share/sporemodder-fx by default).
Decline the editor's own "update available" dialog: updates arrive through
this package, and the launcher restores the packaged version on every start.
EOF
}
